l_basis': 'Implicitly related to property defect law', 'factual_basis': "Based on Thor Berntsen's expert opinion, who is a specialist in concrete and has inspected the site.", 'relief_sought': 'Betongdekket må rives og gjenoppbygges (The concrete slab must be demolished and rebuilt)', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'plaintiff', 'significance': 'medium'}, {'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'Implicitly related to planning and building law', 'factual_basis': "Based on Tommy Hansen's experienced assessment; Bergen municipality is unlikely to approve dispensation as the area is regulated as a green area.", 'relief_sought': 'Svært usikkert om makeskifte godkjennes (It is very uncertain if land exchange will be approved)', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'plaintiff', 'significance': 'medium'}], 'file_id': '73b6ca73-6ae8-441e-961c-0c0a5d2192dc', 'key_provisions': [], 'file_date': '2025-06-15', 'category': 'internal_memo'}
