{'description': "Meeting minutes from a site inspection (befaring) at Fjellveien 42A on June 24, 2025, conducted by Hordaland Tingrett. Attendees include the judge, both plaintiffs (Anders and Berit Kristiansen), their lawyer (Emma Hansen), the defendant (Carl Danielsen), his lawyer (Fredrik Larsen), and experts (Tommy Hansen and Tore Bakke). The inspection covered the annex, concrete slab/terrace, outhouse/winter garden, retaining walls, and property boundaries. Observations were made regarding moisture damage, cracks, encroachment on neighbor's property, and unapproved structures, with differing expert opinions on their severity and rectifiability.", 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['Ragnhild Haugen', 'Anders Kristiansen', 'Berit Kristiansen', 'Emma Hansen', 'Carl Danielsen', 'Fredrik Larsen', 'Tommy Hansen', 'Tore Bakke'], 'deadlines': [], 'damages': [], 'claims': [], 'file_id': 'd6b034b1-66d1-483f-bebe-a515fb6d1b3a', 'key_provisions': [], 'file_date': '2025-06-24', 'category': 'meeting_minutes'}
