{'description': "Notes from the witness testimony of Tommy Hansen, an property advisor from BERAS, at Rogaland Tingrett on June 24, 2025. Hansen, an expert in building cases and application processes, described several serious deviations at the property: the annex is outside the property line and on a green area, the concrete slab has structural weaknesses, the outhouse is illegally placed, and three retaining walls are unapproved (one over the boundary). He testified with certainty that Bergen municipality would not grant dispensation for the annex's encroachment due to the area being regulated as a common play area, estimating significant costs for alternative solutions (e.g., re-zoning). He also agreed with Betongteknikk AS's assessment of the concrete slab's corrosion risk and the need for demolition and reconstruction. He confirmed that Mur A needs to be moved and Murs B and C require an application process. During cross-examination, he clarified his experience and observations.", 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['Tommy Hansen', 'Rogaland Tingrett', 'Emma Hansen', 'Fredrik Larsen', 'Betongteknikk AS'], 'deadlines': [], 'damages': [], 'claims': [{'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'Building and planning law', 'factual_basis': 'The annex is placed approximately 0.8 meters outside the property boundary to the east, in violation of the building permit and agreement with the neighbor, and is on an area regulated as a green space/common play area. Bergen municipality will not grant dispensation.', 'relief_sought': 'Legalization of the annex through dispensation is highly unlikely.', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'expert', 'significance': 'medium'}, {'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'Building codes/standards', 'factual_basis': 'The concrete slab is not built according to accepted performance standards, lacks support beams, and has uncertain load-bearing capacity. Armoring is in an area with moisture and oxygen, leading to rust and weakening over time. Demolition and reconstruction are necessary.', 'relief_sought': 'The concrete slab needs demolition and reconstruction.', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'expert', 'significance': 'medium'}, {'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'Building and property law', 'factual_basis': 'Wall A is partially over the property boundary and must be moved. Walls B and C are unapproved and require an application process for legalization.', 'relief_sought': 'Wall A needs to be moved; Walls B and C need legalization.', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'expert', 'significance': 'medium'}], 'file_id': '0b3f0268-1796-48c2-8db4-9b865e19eeeb', 'key_provisions': [], 'file_date': '2025-06-24', 'category': 'witness_statement'}
