{'description': "Tore Bakke, an authorized appraiser and building engineer, testified about the concrete slab and property boundary issues. He believes a floating beam solution is adequate for the concrete slab (800k-1M NOK), stopping water and fully relieving the existing deck. He also thinks property boundary legalization through makeskifte is possible and that walls B and C can be legalized through application (85k NOK per wall). He disagreed with Betongteknikk AS's assessment. He acknowledged not having measured crack depth or moisture levels, and his informal conversation with the municipality for makeskifte was undocumented.", 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['expert', 'defense_counsel', 'legal_rep_defendant', 'legal_rep_plaintiff', 'judge'], 'deadlines': [], 'damages': [{'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 800000, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'Cost of floating beam solution for concrete slab', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 1000000, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'Cost of floating beam solution for concrete slab', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 85000, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'Legalization cost per wall (Mur B and C)', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}], 'claims': [{'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'N/A', 'factual_basis': 'Dekket har tilstrekkelig kapasitet, riving er unødvendig kostbart.', 'relief_sought': 'Svevende bjelkelag er tilstrekkelig utbedringsmetode.', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'defendant', 'significance': 'medium'}, {'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'N/A', 'factual_basis': "'Tak over tak'-løsningen er faglig forsvarlig og kostnadseffektiv, makeskifte med nabo og dispensasjon fra kommune kan løse boundary issue.", 'relief_sought': 'Bestrider grunnlaget for heving, erkjenner enkelte avvik som kan utbedres, prisavslag er for høyt.', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'defendant', 'significance': 'medium'}], 'file_id': 'a56074b0-9ba3-4d7e-9e1d-86f805415a0c', 'key_provisions': ['solution with floating beam structure is fully defensible', 'will stop all water intrusion', 'will completely relieve the existing deck', 'will provide a new, code-compliant construction above', 'corrosion requires both water and oxygen. The cracks here are so small that there is no access to oxygen in the structure.', 'a part of the ceiling damage comes from poor ventilation in the room, not from the deck.', 'cracks run in arbitrary directions. This is not typical for structural problems.', 'cost of floating beam solution: approx. 800,000 - 1 million kroner.', 'good possibilities for makeskifte (property swap)', 'Mur B and C can be legalized through application process. Cost approx. 85,000 kroner per wall.', 'Mur A must be rectified in connection with makeskifte.'], 'file_date': '2025-06-24', 'category': 'witness_statement'}
