{'description': 'Thor Berntsen, a civil engineer specializing in concrete structures, testified for the plaintiff. He concluded that the concrete slab has significant issues (no documentation, missing load-bearing beams, moisture, cracks allowing oxygen to rebar) and that the proposed floating beam solution is insufficient. He stated that corrosion will continue, leading to further weakening, cracking, spalling, and eventually safety risks. He recommended demolition and reconstruction of the deck (estimated 3.5M NOK). He disagreed with Tore Bakke and Thomas Strand.', 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['expert', 'legal_rep_plaintiff', 'defense_counsel', 'judge'], 'deadlines': [], 'damages': [{'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 3500000, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'Demolition and reconstruction of concrete slab', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}], 'claims': [{'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'N/A', 'factual_basis': 'Usikker bæreevne, risiko for videre svekkelse pga. korrosjon.', 'relief_sought': 'Betongdekket må rives og gjenoppbygges.', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'plaintiff', 'significance': 'medium'}, {'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'N/A', 'factual_basis': 'Mangler ved Fjellveien 42A, especially concrete slab and property boundary issues.', 'relief_sought': 'Heving av eiendomskjøp og erstatning.', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'plaintiff', 'significance': 'medium'}], 'file_id': '86d783f9-00fa-4562-b1a0-3652238fb005', 'key_provisions': ['no documentation on design', 'missing load-bearing beams', 'deviation from pre-accepted performance', 'moisture in the elements', 'cracks that allow access to rebar', 'rebar in the concrete slab lies in a layer of polyconcrete - lightweight concrete with styrofoam. This is a draining material that allows both moisture and oxygen to the rebar.', 'when both moisture and oxygen are present, corrosion occurs - rust on the rebar. This weakens the structure over time.', 'measured crack depth between 0.3 and 0.5 mm. That is enough for oxygen to reach the rebar.', 'what were cracks have become cracks in several places. This shows that the structure continues to weaken.', 'floating beam solution has a very limited function... it does not solve the underlying problem.', 'corrosion process will continue.', 'very difficult to dry out this type of structure.', 'will likely happen: further deflection of the deck, more cracks, accelerated corrosion, spalling of concrete, falling concrete pieces.', 'in the long run, yes [safety risk].', 'necessary to demolish the deck and rebuild it to get a safe and code-compliant structure.', 'cost of demolition and reconstruction: approx. 3.5 million kroner (Skandia Bygg offer).'], 'file_date': '2025-06-24', 'category': 'witness_statement'}
