{'description': "Thomas Strand, a civil engineer, testified for the defendant. He believes a floating beam solution is acceptable for the concrete slab, assuming it's relieved and water ingress stops. He disagreed with Betongteknikk AS, stating most structures can be dried. He based his assessment solely on documentation from 2021 and had not inspected the property. He acknowledged that new information (moisture, deeper cracks) could change his conclusion and that his report had limitations due to lack of site visit.", 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['expert', 'defense_counsel', 'legal_rep_plaintiff', 'judge'], 'deadlines': [], 'damages': [], 'claims': [{'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'N/A', 'factual_basis': 'Dekket har tilstrekkelig kapasitet, riving er unødvendig kostbart.', 'relief_sought': 'Svevende bjelkelag er tilstrekkelig utbedringsmetode.', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'defendant', 'significance': 'medium'}], 'file_id': '71e4e977-10eb-4ca8-8c79-184edaeaf68e', 'key_provisions': ['floating beam solution is acceptable provided the deck is relieved and water ingress is stopped.', 'corrosion requires both moisture and oxygen. If the structure is dried and not exposed to more water, the corrosion rate will be very low.', 'most structures can be dried with proper measures.', 'demolition is not necessary.'], 'file_date': '2025-06-25', 'category': 'witness_statement'}
