{'description': "Court judgment from Rogaland Tingrett in the case of Anders and Berit Kristiansen vs. Carl Danielsen and NordicGuard Insurance AS. The court ruled that the settlement agreement of March 30, 2022, is invalid, and the purchase agreement for Fjellveien 42A is rescinded. The defendants are ordered to pay 6,280,000 NOK (return of purchase price), 1,072,413 NOK (damages), and 628,227 NOK (legal costs) to the plaintiffs. The court found significant defects in the property (addition over boundary, concrete slab structural flaws, illegal walls, missing door, insulation, moisture, radon barrier issues, illegal outhouse). The court sided with the plaintiffs' experts that the concrete slab needs demolition and reconstruction. The claim for lost rental income and avsavnsrente was rejected.", 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['judge', 'plaintiff', 'legal_rep_plaintiff', 'insurer', 'legal_rep_defendant', 'defendant', 'expert', 'contractor'], 'deadlines': [{'deadline_id': None, 'deadline_date': '2025-07-30', 'description': 'Payment deadline for the judgment.', 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'high'}, {'deadline_id': None, 'deadline_date': '2025-08-16', 'description': 'Appeal deadline for the judgment (1 month from pronouncement, excluding court holidays).', 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'high'}], 'damages': [{'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 6280000, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'Return of purchase price upon transfer of title.', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'damage_id': None, 'category': 'consequential', 'amount': 1072413, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'Total damages awarded by the court.', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 628227, 'currency': 'NO