ssues (property boundary, construction of addition, unapproved walls).', 'relief_sought': 'Saksøkte bestrider at det foreligger opplysningssvikt.', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'defendant', 'significance': 'high'}, {'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'avhl. § 4-14', 'factual_basis': "The defects are hidden and outside the seller's control.", 'relief_sought': 'Seller is not liable for compensation.', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'defendant', 'significance': 'high'}], 'file_id': 'd4900c51-77c8-42f5-b2bc-3e7b5383b5c3', 'key_provisions': ['avhl. § 3-9', 'avhl. §§ 3-7', '3-8', 'avhl. § 4-19', 'avhl. § 4-13 (1)', 'avhl. § 4-13', 'avhl. § 4-14', 'tvisteloven'], 'file_date': '2025-06-06', 'category': 'pleading'}
