{'title': 'Rescission Declaration - Property Purchase Fjellveien 42A', 'description': 'A formal rescission declaration from Juridisk Byrå AS, on behalf of Anders and Berit Kristiansen, to Carl Danielsen and NordicGuard Insurance AS. It details significant defects found at Fjellveien 42A, including concrete deck issues, property boundary problems, an illegal outbuilding, and other technical deviations. The document claims these defects constitute a material breach, justifying rescission under the Property Transfer Act § 4-13, and demands a total of NOK 9,778,904 in settlement, including the purchase price, costs, lost value, lost rental income, moving costs, improvements, and rectification costs. A 14-day deadline for response is set.', 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['Juridisk Byrå AS', 'Emma Hansen', 'Anders Kristiansen', 'Berit Kristiansen', 'Carl Danielsen', 'NordicGuard Insurance AS'], 'deadlines': [{'deadline_id': None, 'deadline_date': '2021-07-05', 'description': 'Deadline for Carl Danielsen and NordicGuard Insurance AS to respond and settle the rescission claim.', 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'defendant', 'significance': 'high'}], 'damages': [{'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 7030000, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'Repayment of purchase price.', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'high'}, {'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 186600, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'Costs incurred during the purchase.', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'high'}, {'damage_id': None, 'category': 'consequential', 'amount': 2210000, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'Lost appreciation in value.', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'high'}, {'damage_id': None, 'category': 'consequential', 'amount': 307204, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis'