{'title': 'Technical Assessment - Concrete Deck Fjellveien 42A', 'description': 'A technical assessment by Konsulent Gruppen AS for Carl Danielsen and NordicGuard Insurance AS, dated October 21, 2021, evaluating the concrete deck\'s load-bearing capacity at Fjellveien 42A based on documentation (no physical inspection). It concludes that the deck has sufficient capacity for current use despite deviations from pre-accepted solutions, and that cracks do not indicate overload. It recommends a floating joist system ("tak over tak") and internal crack sealing as sufficient, deeming demolition and reconstruction unnecessary and costly.', 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['Carl Danielsen', 'NordicGuard Insurance AS', 'Konsulent Gruppen AS', 'Thomas Strand'], 'deadlines': [], 'damages': [], 'claims': [{'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'Implied defense against claims of material defect.', 'factual_basis': 'Deck has sufficient load-bearing capacity for current use; cracks do not indicate overload; deviations do not necessarily mean insufficiency.', 'relief_sought': 'Rejection of claims for demolition/reconstruction of concrete deck.', 'strength_assessment': 'moderate', 'defense': 'The concrete deck has sufficient load-bearing capacity for current use, and a floating joist system is a sufficient and more cost-effective solution than demolition and rebuilding.', 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'defendant', 'significance': 'high'}], 'file_id': '7d62c114-823e-412f-a8c7-b9ccdeb82ced', 'key_provisions': ['dekket har tilstrekkelig kapasitet til å bære egen vekt samt begrenset snølast.', 'Selv om det er avvik fra preakseptert løsning, innebærer ikke dette nødvendigvis at konstruksjonen er utilstrekkelig.', 'Riving og gjenoppbygging fremstår som unødvendig kostbart tiltak.', 'Anbefalt løsning med svevende bjelkelag vil være tilstrekkelig for å sikre konstruksjonen.'], 'file_date': '2021-10-21', 'category': 'expert_report'}
