{'title': 'Expert Report - Concrete Deck Structural Assessment', 'description': 'A technical report by Thomas Strand of Teknisk Rådgivning AS, commissioned by Advokatfirmaet Nord, assessing the concrete deck in the annex at Fjellveien 42A. Based on existing documentation (no physical inspection), it highlights uncertainty regarding the deck\'s load-bearing capacity due to missing documentation, deviations from pre-accepted performance, and observed damages (leaks, cracks). It evaluates a floating joist system ("tak over tak") as an acceptable, cost-effective solution to prevent further water intrusion and relieve the existing deck, but notes it doesn\'t eliminate all uncertainty. Full demolition and rebuilding would be preferable for complete safety, but is more costly.', 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['Advokatfirmaet Nord', 'Fredrik Larsen', 'Teknisk Rådgivning AS', 'Thomas Strand'], 'deadlines': [], 'damages': [], 'claims': [{'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'Implied, related to building regulations and property defects.', 'factual_basis': "Uncertainty regarding concrete deck's load-bearing capacity due to missing documentation, deviations from pre-accepted performance, and observed damages (leaks, cracks).", 'relief_sought': 'Resolution of concrete deck issues, potentially through a floating joist system or demolition/rebuilding.', 'strength_assessment': 'moderate', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'plaintiff', 'significance': 'high'}], 'file_id': '165e02ab-c432-426e-b2a1-461944f43057', 'key_provisions': ['Det er usikkerhet knyttet til eksisterende betongdekkes bæreevne grunnet: Manglende dokumentasjon, Avvik fra preakseptert ytelse, Observerte skader.', 'Løsning med svevende bjelkelag vil avlaste eksisterende konstruksjon og hindre videre skader. Dette vurderes som en akseptabel løsning, selv om den ikke eliminerer all usikkerhet.', 'For full sikkerhet ville riving og gjenoppbygging vært å foretrekke'], 'file_date': '2021-10-21', 'category': 'expert_report'}
