oist system proved unsatisfactory.", 'relief_sought': "Settlement agreement of March 30, 2022, is void and parties' obligations under it have ceased.", 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'avhendingsloven § 4-13', 'factual_basis': 'Extensive defects in the property, including severe structural flaws in the concrete deck, property boundary violations, illegal outbuilding, and unapproved walls, constitute a material breach, and the seller acted with gross negligence.', 'relief_sought': 'Carl Danielsen and NordicGuard Insurance AS ordered to pay Anders Kristiansen and Berit Kristiansen NOK 7,030,000 against transfer of title for Fjellveien 42A.', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'avhendingsloven § 4-14', 'factual_basis': 'Claimed compensation includes lost appreciation in value (NOK 2,210,000), lost rental income (NOK 307,204), purchase costs (NOK 186,600), moving costs (NOK 49,662), improvements (NOK 49,287), and incurred rectification costs (NOK 6,151).', 'relief_sought': 'Carl Danielsen and NordicGuard Insurance AS ordered to pay Anders Kristiansen and Berit Kristiansen compensation up to NOK 2,748,904.', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'Implied by general legal principles', 'factual_basis': 'Loss of use of the purchase money from the takeover date (August 1, 2019).', 'relief_sought': 'Carl Danielsen and NordicGuard Insurance AS ordered to pay Anders Kristiansen and Berit Kristiansen interest on the purchase price (1.6% p.a. on NOK 7,030,000) from August 1, 2019, to July 21, 2021.', 'strength_assessment': 'moderate', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'Implied', 'factual_basis': 'Extensive defects in the property resulting in significant rectification costs.', 'relief_sought': 'Price reduction equivalent to rectification costs (NOK 7,766,734) and compensation for lost rental income (NOK 307,204).', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'Implied contract law regarding validity of settlement.', 'factual_basis': 'Settlement agreement is valid and binding; efforts made to fulfill obligations; delays due to third parties; no strict deadline for application; new report conclusions disputed; floating joist solution is viable.', 'relief_sought': 'Rejection of rescission, upholding of settlement agreement, challenging new expert report.', 'strength_assessment': 'weak', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'Avhendingsloven § 3-9, Avhendingsloven § 3-7, Avhendingsloven § 4-13, Avhendingsloven § 4-14', 'factual_basis': 'Eiendommen ble solgt "som den er"; ingen opplysningssvikt; selger hadde ikke kunnskap om de påståtte forholdene; anerkjennelse av enkelte avvik (oppbygging av tilbygget/betongdekket, overskridelse av tomtegrensen, uthuset, manglende dør mellom boenheter, murene); bestridt utbedringsmetode; eiendomsgrenseproblemer kan legaliseres; ikke vesentlig mislighold; for sent fremsatt hevingserklæring; ikke grunnlag for erstatning.', 'relief_sought': 'Carl Danielsen og NordicGuard Insurance AS frifinnes; subsidiært: Carl Danielsen og NordicGuard Insurance AS dømmes til å betale prisavslag og eventuelt erstatning til Anders Kristiansen og Berit Kristiansen oppad begrenset etter rettens skjønn; Anders Kristiansen og Berit Kristiansen dømmes til å erstatte Carl Danielsen og NordicGuard Insurance AS sine sakskostnader.', 'strength_a