{'title': 'Response to Summons', 'description': 'A legal response from Carl Danielsen and NordicGuard Insurance AS to a summons, denying most claims and proposing alternative resolutions. It discusses property defects, disclosure failures, disputed repair methods, property boundary issues, and challenges the basis for rescission and compensation claims.', 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['plaintiff', 'defendant', 'insurer', 'legal_rep_defendant', 'expert', 'witness'], 'deadlines': [], 'damages': [], 'claims': [{'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'avhendingsloven § 3-9', 'factual_basis': "Property was sold 'as is', meaning risk for hidden defects is largely transferred to the buyer.", 'relief_sought': 'Carl Danielsen and NordicGuard Insurance AS be acquitted.', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'defendant', 'significance': 'medium'}, {'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'avhendingsloven § 3-7', 'factual_basis': "It is denied that there was a failure to disclose information. The seller had no knowledge of the alleged conditions (property within boundary, construction of addition, unapproved walls) and answered buyer's questions to the best of their ability.", 'relief_sought': 'Carl Danielsen and NordicGuard Insurance AS be acquitted.', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'defendant', 'significance': 'medium'}, {'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'Implied by property defect claim', 'factual_basis': 'Acknowledged deviations include the construction of the addition/concrete slab, overstepping of the property boundary, the outhouse, missing door between units, and the walls.', 'relief_sought': "Alternative: Carl Danielsen and NordicGuard Insurance AS ordered to pay price reduction and possibly compensation, limited at court's discretion.", 'strength_assessment': 'moderate', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'defendant', 'significance': 'medium'}, {'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'Implied by property defect claim', 'factual_basis': "It is disputed that the addition must be demolished and rebuilt. The defendant's expert (Konsulent Gruppen AS v/Thomas Strand) believes the deck has sufficient bearing capacity and a floating joist solution is sufficient.", 'relief_sought': 'Carl Danielsen and NordicGuard Insurance AS be acquitted or pay reduced compensation.', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'defendant', 'significance': 'medium'}, {'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'Implied by property defect claim', 'factual_basis': 'It is disputed that the property boundary problem cannot be solved. A signed draft agreement exists with the neighbor for an exchange, and the municipality will likely approve a minor boundary adjustment.', 'relief_sought': 'Carl Danielsen and NordicGuard Insurance AS be acquitted.', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'defendant', 'significance': 'medium'}, {'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'avhendingsloven § 4-13', 'factual_basis': "It is disputed that there are grounds for rescission. Even if there are defects, they are not of a character to constitute a material breach. Repair costs should be set at the defendant's lower estimate.", 'relief_sought': 'Carl Danielsen and NordicGuard Insurance AS be acquitted.', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': 'Not a material breach, and rescission declaration was submitted too late.', 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'defendant', 'significance': 'medium'}, {'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'avhendingsloven § 4-13', 'factual_basis': 'The rescission declaration was submitted on June 21, 2021, almost two years after takeover and long after the defects were discovered, thus it was submitted too late.', 'relief_sought': 'Carl Danielsen and NordicGuard Insurance AS be acquitted.', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': 'Rescission declaration submitted too late.', 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'defendant', 'significance': 'medium'}, {'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'avhendingsloven § 4-14', 'factual_basis': "It is disputed that there are grounds for compensation. The defects are hidden and outside the seller's control. Plaintiff's compensation claims for lost appreciation, lost rental income, and deduction for living benefits are disputed.", 'relief_sought': 'Carl Danielsen and NordicGuard Insurance AS be acquitted.', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'defendant', 'significance': 'medium'}, {'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'Implied by compensation claim', 'factual_basis': 'Interest for deprivation should not be awarded when compensation for lost appreciation is awarded for the same period.', 'relief_sought': 'Carl Danielsen and NordicGuard Insurance AS be acquitted or pay reduced compensation.', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'defendant', 'significance': 'medium'}], 'file_id': 'edf2c82a-f542-48f6-9148-d58d8354253a', 'key_provisions': ['Eiendommen ble solgt "som den er" jf. avhendingsloven § 3-9.', 'Det bestrides at det foreligger opplysningssvikt etter avhendingsloven § 3-7.', 'Det bestrides at tilbygget må rives og gjenoppbygges.', 'Det bestrides at eiendomsgrenseproblemet ikke kan løses.', 'Det bestrides at det foreligger grunnlag for heving etter avhendingsloven § 4-13.', 'Hevingserklæringen ble fremsatt 21. juni 2021, nesten to år etter overtakelse og lang tid etter at manglene ble oppdaget.', 'Det bestrides at det foreligger grunnlag for erstatning etter avhendingsloven § 4-14.'], 'file_date': '2021-12-20', 'category': 'pleading'}
