{'title': 'Notes from Witness Testimony: Tore Bakke', 'description': "Tore Bakke, a building engineer and authorized appraiser, testified in court on June 24, 2025, about property defects at Fjellveien 42A. He believes a floating joist system is a defensible solution for the concrete deck, costing 800,000-1,000,000 NOK. He also thinks boundary adjustment for the property line is possible, and walls B and C can be legalized for 85,000 NOK each. He disagreed with Betongteknikk AS's assessment.", 'significance': 'medium', 'party_roles': ['Tore Bakke', 'adv. Larsen', 'adv. Hansen', 'retten'], 'deadlines': [], 'damages': [{'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 800000, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': "Cost for 'tak over tak' solution for concrete deck", 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 1000000, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': "Cost for 'tak over tak' solution for concrete deck", 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 85000, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'Cost to legalize walls', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}], 'claims': [{'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'Implied by property defect claim', 'factual_basis': "It is disputed that the addition must be demolished and rebuilt. The defendant's expert (Konsulent Gruppen AS v/Thomas Strand) believes the deck has sufficient bearing capacity and a floating joist solution is sufficient.", 'relief_sought': 'Carl Danielsen and NordicGuard Insurance AS be acquitted.', 'strength_assessment': 'moderate', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'Implied by property defect claim', 'factual_basis': 'It is disputed that the property boundary problem cannot be solved. A signed draft agreement exists with the neighbor for an exchange, and the municipality will likely approve a minor boundary adjustment.', 'relief_sought': 'Carl Danielsen and NordicGuard Insurance AS be acquitted.', 'strength_assessment': 'moderate', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}], 'file_id': '2290ab81-cadc-4ec8-8470-86a262dc0f8c', 'key_provisions': [], 'file_date': '2025-06-24', 'category': 'witness_statement'}
