{'title': 'Judgment in Property Defect Case', 'description': "A judgment issued by Rogaland Tingrett on July 16, 2025, in the case of Anders and Berit Kristiansen against Carl Danielsen and NordicGuard Insurance AS. The court ruled that the settlement agreement of March 30, 2022, is void, the property purchase is rescinded, and the defendants must pay 6,280,000 NOK for the purchase price, 1,072,413 NOK in damages, and 628,227 NOK in legal costs. The judgment details the property defects, including boundary violations, structural defects in the concrete deck, and unapproved walls, and argues against the defendant's claim of late rescission.", 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['Anders Kristiansen', 'Berit Kristiansen', 'Carl Danielsen', 'NordicGuard Insurance AS', 'Emma Hansen', 'Fredrik Larsen', 'Ingrid Andersen', 'K2 Taksering AS', 'Byggesøknad Bergen AS', 'Bergen Eiendomsrådgivning AS', 'Tore Bakke', 'Tommy Hansen', 'BERAS', 'Stavanger Takst AS', 'Betongteknikk AS', 'Teknisk Rådgivning AS', 'Sivertsen Entreprenør AS', 'Stavanger Takstsenter AS', 'Tertnes Entreprenør AS', 'Øygarden Betongentreprenør AS', 'Martin Solberg'], 'deadlines': [{'deadline_id': '30d1cac3-d59e-458a-9169-a931b704c2dd', 'deadline_date': '2021-07-21', 'description': 'Deadline for payment of interest on the purchase price, 30 days after the rescission claim.', 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'high'}, {'deadline_id': '30d1cac3-d59e-458a-9169-a931b704c2dd', 'deadline_date': '2025-07-30', 'description': 'Fulfillment deadline for payment of damages and legal costs, two weeks from the proclamation of the judgment.', 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'high'}], 'damages': [{'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 7030000, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'Kjøpesum (Purchase price) for repayment.', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'dam