{'title': 'Formal Notice: Annulment of Settlement Agreement', 'description': 'Juridisk Byrå AS formally annuls the settlement agreement (March 30, 2022) with Carl Danielsen and NordicGuard Insurance AS, citing contract breach (failure to send application), material breach, and frustrated assumptions based on a new technical report (BetongTeknikk AS, 24.02.2023) showing the proposed solution is unsatisfactory and demolition/reconstruction is needed. They will ask the court to reopen the case and reserve all rights from the original summons.', 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['Juridisk Byrå AS', 'Anders Kristiansen', 'Berit Kristiansen', 'Carl Danielsen', 'NordicGuard Insurance AS', 'Fredrik Larsen', 'Emma Hansen', 'Thor Berntsen', 'BetongTeknikk AS'], 'deadlines': [], 'damages': [], 'claims': [], 'file_id': 'da36819c-54eb-451a-8b26-45ce05c6333c', 'key_provisions': ['Annulment of settlement agreement entered into on March 30, 2022.', 'Grounds for annulment: Contract breach (failure to send application for over 1 year, equating to non-approval).', 'Grounds for annulment: Material breach of the settlement agreement.', "Grounds for annulment: Frustrated assumptions (settlement based on reparability with 'floating joist system', new report from BetongTeknikk AS (24.02.2023) states this is unsatisfactory and deck requires demolition/reconstruction).", 'Intent to request the district court to reopen the case.', 'Reservation of all rights under the original summons.'], 'file_date': '2023-04-18', 'category': 'legal_opinion'}
