{'title': 'Judgment', 'description': 'The judgment from Rogaland Tingrett on July 16, 2025, in the case between Anders and Berit Kristiansen (plaintiffs) and Carl Danielsen and NordicGuard Insurance AS (defendants). The court ruled that the settlement agreement of March 30, 2022, is void. It found significant defects in the property (extension over property line, concrete slab construction errors, illegal walls, outhouse) constituting a material breach, granting the plaintiffs the right to annul the property purchase. The defendants are ordered to pay 6,280,000 NOK for the returned purchase price (against title transfer), 1,072,413 NOK in damages (for transaction costs, lost value appreciation, moving costs, property improvements, incurred remediation costs, minus a partial payment), and 628,227 NOK in legal costs. The claim for lost rental income and interest on the purchase price was rejected.', 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['Anders Kristiansen', 'Berit Kristiansen', 'Carl Danielsen', 'NordicGuard Insurance AS', 'Emma Hansen', 'Fredrik Larsen', 'Ingrid Andersen', 'Berit Jensen'], 'deadlines': [{'deadline_id': None, 'deadline_date': '2025-07-30', 'description': 'Fulfillment deadline for payment of damages and legal costs.', 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'defendant', 'significance': 'high'}], 'damages': [{'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 6280000, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'Return of purchase price upon annulment.', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 1072413, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'Total damages awarded for transaction costs, lost value appreciation, moving costs, property improvements, and incurred remediation costs.', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 