{'title': 'Technical Assessment: Concrete Slab Fjellveien 42A', 'description': 'A technical assessment from Konsulent Gruppen AS for Carl Danielsen / NordicGuard Insurance AS, dated October 21, 2021, evaluating the concrete slab at Fjellveien 42A. Concludes the slab has sufficient bearing capacity for current use, that demolition and reconstruction are unnecessary, and recommends a floating joist system and crack sealing.', 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['Carl Danielsen', 'NordicGuard Insurance AS', 'Thomas Strand', 'Konsulent Gruppen AS'], 'deadlines': [], 'damages': [], 'claims': [], 'file_id': 'dc0b4244-9a55-4f8a-8517-5c984c57eb39', 'key_provisions': ['Concrete slab has sufficient bearing capacity for current use', 'Demolition and reconstruction are unnecessary and costly', "Recommended solution: establishing a floating joist system ('tak over tak') to prevent water intrusion and relieve snow load", 'Recommended: sealing existing cracks internally with epoxy-injection', 'Regular inspection of cracks and monitoring of changes'], 'file_date': '2021-10-21', 'category': 'expert_report'}
