{'title': 'Petition for Resumption of Case (Hordaland District Court)', 'description': 'Anders and Berit Kristiansen, through Emma Hansen, petition the Hordaland District Court to resume case 21-163881TVI-THRD/TBER, arguing the settlement agreement is invalid due to non-compliance (application not sent within 3 months), changed circumstances (new report shows repair is impossible), and impossibility (failed land swap with neighbor).', 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['Anders Kristiansen', 'Berit Kristiansen', 'Emma Hansen'], 'deadlines': [{'deadline_id': None, 'deadline_date': '2022-06-30', 'description': 'Deadline for sending application (3 months after March 30, 2022)', 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'legal_rep_plaintiff', 'significance': 'high'}, {'deadline_id': None, 'deadline_date': '2024-03-31', 'description': 'Maximum 24-month period for case abeyance expires', 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'legal_rep_plaintiff', 'significance': 'high'}], 'damages': [], 'claims': [{'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'Avtaleloven § 36, Tvisteloven § 16-17', 'factual_basis': 'The settlement agreement is invalid due to: a) Misconduct: Application was supposed to be sent within 3 months (deadline June 30, 2022), but 12 months later, no application has been sent. b) Changed circumstances (avtaleloven § 36): The settlement was based on the assumption that the deck could be repaired, but a new report (attached) shows this is not possible. c) Impossibility: Land swap with neighbor failed, and the neighbor sets unacceptable conditions. The case has been suspended since March 2022 (14 months), and the maximum 24-month period expires in March 2024, leaving enough time to complete the case before the deadline.', 'relief_sought': 'Resumption of case', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'plaintiff', 'significance': 'medium'}], 'file_id': 'dfb4a44d-0137-4485-aede-977357d7ee3e', 'key_provisions': ['Søknad skulle sendes innen 3 mnd (frist 30. juni 2022)', '12 måneder senere: Fortsatt ingen søknad sendt', 'Forlik basert på at dekket kunne repareres', 'Ny rapport (vedlagt) viser dette ikke er mulig', 'Makeskifte med nabo mislyktes', 'Nabo stiller uakseptable vilkår', 'Sak i bero siden mars 2022 (14 måneder)', 'Maksimum 24 måneder løper ut mars 2024'], 'file_date': '2023-06-16', 'category': 'pleading'}
