{'title': 'Formal letter rescinding settlement agreement', 'description': "Juridisk Byrå AS, on behalf of Anders and Berit Kristiansen, formally rescinds the settlement agreement dated March 30, 2022, citing Carl Danielsen's breach of contract (failure to submit application for over a year and ensure boundary adjustment), which is deemed equivalent to non-approval of the measures. They also claim significant breach and frustrated assumptions, as a new report from BetongTeknikk AS (Feb 24, 2023) indicates the deck solution is unsatisfactory, requiring demolition and reconstruction. The letter states intent to resume the original lawsuit.", 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['legal_rep_plaintiff', 'defendant', 'insurer', 'legal_rep_defendant', 'injured_party'], 'deadlines': [], 'damages': [], 'claims': [{'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'Kontraktsbrudd', 'factual_basis': 'It has been over 1 year since the settlement agreement was entered into, and no application has been sent to the municipality. The defendant has also not ensured "necessary boundary adjustment". A new report from BetongTeknikk AS (Feb 24, 2023) concludes that the "floating joist solution" is NOT satisfactory and the deck must be demolished and rebuilt.', 'relief_sought': 'Heving av forliksavtale', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': 'a7ce7d2d-2071-4c2e-844e-b80116ac1ef0', 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'legal_rep_plaintiff', 'significance': 'high'}, {'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'Likestilling med "ikke godkjent" (Forlikets punkt 6)', 'factual_basis': 'It has been over 1 year since the settlement agreement was entered into, and no application has been sent to the municipality. The defendant has also not ensured "necessary boundary adjustment". A new report from BetongTeknikk AS (Feb 24, 2023) concludes that the "floating joist solution" is NOT satisfactory and the deck must be demolished and rebuilt.', 'relief_sought': 'Heving av forliksavtale', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': 'a7ce7d2d-2071-4c2e-844e-b80116ac1ef0', 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'legal_rep_plaintiff', 'significance': 'high'}, {'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'Vesentlig mislighold', 'factual_basis': 'It has been over 1 year since the settlement agreement was entered into, and no application has been sent to the municipality. The defendant has also not ensured "necessary boundary adjustment". A new report from BetongTeknikk AS (Feb 24, 2023) concludes that the "floating joist solution" is NOT satisfactory and the deck must be demolished and rebuilt.', 'relief_sought': 'Heving av forliksavtale', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': 'a7ce7d2d-2071-4c2e-844e-b80116ac1ef0', 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'legal_rep_plaintiff', 'significance': 'high'}, {'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'Bristende forutsetninger', 'factual_basis': 'It has been over 1 year since the settlement agreement was entered into, and no application has been sent to the municipality. The defendant has also not ensured "necessary boundary adjustment". A new report from BetongTeknikk AS (Feb 24, 2023) concludes that the "floating joist solution" is NOT satisfactory and the deck must be demolished and rebuilt.', 'relief_sought': 'Heving av forliksavtale', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': 'a7ce7d2d-2071-4c2e-844e-b80116ac1ef0', 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'legal_rep_plaintiff', 'significance': 'high'}, {'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'Implicit in resuming the original lawsuit', 'factual_basis': 'It has been over 1 year since the settlement agreement was entered into, and no application has been sent to the municipality. The defendant has also not ensured "necessary boundary adjustment". A new report from BetongTeknikk AS (Feb 24, 2023) concludes that the "floating joist solution" is NOT satisfactory and the deck must be demolished and rebuilt.', 'relief_sought': 'Be tingretten om å bringe saken i gang igjen.', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': 'a7ce7d2d-2071-4c2e-844e-b80116ac1ef0', 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'legal_rep_plaintiff', 'significance': 'high'}], 'file_id': 'a7ce7d2d-2071-4c2e-844e-b80116ac1ef0', 'key_provisions': ['Kontraktsbrudd: Punkt 2 fastsatte at søknad skulle sendes "så snart som mulig". Det har nå gått over 12 måneder uten at søknad er sendt. Saksøkte har heller ikke sørget for "nødvendig grensejustering".', 'Likestilling med "ikke godkjent": Forlikets punkt 6 fastsetter at "Dersom tiltak i pkt 2 ikke godkjennes skal saken settes i gang igjen." Å ikke sende inn søknad på over 1 år må likestilles med at tiltaket ikke godkjennes.', 'Vesentlig mislighold: Subsidiært gjøres det gjeldende at det foreligger vesentlig mislighold av forliksavtalen som gir rett til å si seg løst fra avtalen etter alminnelige obligasjonsrettslige prinsipper.', 'Bristende forutsetninger: Forliket bygget på et premiss om at betongkonstruksjonen i tilbygget ville la seg utbedre med løsningen "svevende bjelkelag". Ny rapport fra BetongTeknikk AS konkluderer med at denne løsningen IKKE er tilfredsstillende. Dekket må rives og gjenoppbygges.'], 'file_date': '2023-04-18', 'category': 'correspondence'}
