ication process for walls and winter garden - estimated based on BERAS report of 09.09.24.', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 499518, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'Moving of wall (east) by addition, approx. 12 meters - price quote Tertnes Entreprenør AS of 17.02.25.', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'damage_id': None, 'category': 'consequential', 'amount': 1000000, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'Value loss for loss of parking when wall (east) is moved - Report Eiendomsmegler Vest.', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 1789918, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'Moving wall (north) by garage, approx. 27 and 16 meters - estimate based on Tertnes price quote of 499.518 for 12m wall = 41.626 per meter.', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'damage_id': None, 'category': 'consequential', 'amount': 1000000, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'Value loss for loss of parking when wall (north) is moved - Report Eiendomsmegler Vest.', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': -60000, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'Deduction for rest from partial payment.', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}], 'claims': [{'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'avhendingsloven §§ 3-7, 3-9, 4-13, 4-14', 'factual_basis': 'Significant defects in concrete slab, property boundaries, outbuilding, walls, and other technical deviations; remediation costs exceed 50% of purchase price.', 'relief_sought': 'Principal: Rescission of property purchase (NOK 7,030,000) and compensation (up to NOK 2,748,904) plus interest. Subsidiary: Price reduction (up to NOK 7,766,734) and compensation (up to NOK 307,204) plus interest. In both cases: Legal costs.', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'plaintiff', 'significance': 'medium'}, {'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'Principles of contract law regarding material breach and failed assumptions', 'factual_basis': "Defendants failed to send application 'as soon as possible' as per point 2 of the agreement (over 1 year passed). Expert reports (Betongteknikk AS 2023-02-24) show proposed solution (floating joist system) is insufficient, indicating a fundamental premise of the settlement was flawed.", 'relief_sought': 'Settlement agreement of 2022-03-30 is void.', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'plaintiff', 'significance': 'medium'}, {'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'Implicit legal principles regarding waiver/passivity in legal proceedings', 'factual_basis': 'Rescission declared June 2021, summons November 2021, legal response December 2021 (no objection), mediation March 2022 (no objection), settlement March 2022, various pleadings 2023-2024 (no objection). Objection raised only in November 2024.', 'relief_sought': 'Defendants have lost the right to claim late rescission due to their own passivity.', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'plaintiff', 'significance': 'medium'}], 'file_id': '9edfcef7-fd2d-4079-a08f-27d666ac2a64', 'key_provisions': ['Saksøktes forpliktelse var: “Det skal søkes om igangsettelse av etablering av nytt etasjeskille, og søknad om oppføring og plassering av bod. Det skal søkes om dispensasjon fra reguleringsplan og faktisk plassering mot grense. Søker følger prosessen frem til ferdigattest for det som er omsøkt. Saksøkte sørger for nødvendig grensejustering el. Alle utgifter med dette skal saksøkte bære.”', 'I avtalen står det at om pkt. 2 om søknad ikke godkjennes skal saken settes i gang igjen.'], 'file_date': '2025-06-02', 'category': 'pleading'}
