m advance.', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'damage_id': None, 'category': 'consequential', 'amount': 1072413, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'Total compensation awarded (excluding purchase price repayment and legal costs).', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'damage_id': None, 'category': 'consequential', 'amount': 628227, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'Legal costs awarded to Kristiansens.', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 60000, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'Estimated cost for application process for property boundary legalization.', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 25141, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'Cost for establishing internal door (excl. VAT).', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 186092, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'Minimum cost for remediation of outbuilding (excl. VAT).', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 300000, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'Estimated cost for moving/rebuilding Wall A.', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 100000, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'Estimated cost for legalization of walls B and C (incl. project/execution responsibility and application).', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}], 'claims': [{'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'avhendingsloven §§ 3-7, 3-9, 4-13, 4-14, tvisteloven § 16-17', 'factual_basis': 'Significant defects in concrete slab, property boundaries, outbuilding, walls, and other technical deviations; remediation costs exceed 50% of purchase price. Seller acted grossly negligent. Settlement agreement is void due to non-compliance ("as soon as possible" not met, new expert report showing solution insufficient, maximum 2-year suspension limit exceeded).', 'relief_sought': 'Principal: Rescission of property purchase (NOK 7,030,000) and compensation (up to NOK 2,748,904) plus interest. Subsidiary: Price reduction (up to NOK 7,766,734) and compensation (up to NOK 307,204) plus interest. In both cases: Legal costs.', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'N/A', 'factual_basis': 'The settlement agreement of March 30, 2022, is valid and binding. Application process was initiated but complex, not due to defendant\'s fault. "As soon as possible" allows flexibility. New report disputed, floating joist solution is sufficient.', 'relief_sought': 'Settlement agreement to be upheld', 'strength_assessment': 'weak', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'avhendingsloven § 4-13', 'factual_basis': 'Rescission declaration on 2021-06-21, defects known by May 2020. Over a year passed between reservation of rescission (2020-05-19) and declaration. Settlement agreement (2022-03-30) also implies the rescission claim was abandoned.', 'relief_sought': "Plaintiffs' rescission claim to be dismissed as submitted too late", 'strength_assessment': 'weak', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'avhendingsloven § 4-12', 'factual_basis': 'Even if rescission is timely, there is no material breach. Price reduction is an adequate reaction. Estimated remediation costs are significantly lower than claimed by plaintiffs.', 'relief_sought': 'Carl Danielsen and NordicGuard Insurance AS to pay price reduction to Anders Kristiansen and Berit Kristiansen, limited to NOK 1,500,000', 'strength_assessment': 'moderate', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'avhendingsloven § 3-9, § 3-7, § 4-13, § 4-14', 'factual_basis': "Property sold 'as is'. Seller had no knowledge of alleged conditions. Some deviations acknowledged, but not material breach. Demolition disputed, floating joist solution adequate. Boundary issues resolvable. Rescission declaration too late. No basis for compensation as defects were hidden and outside seller's control, and compensation claims are challenged.", 'relief_sought': 'Carl Danielsen and NordicGuard Insurance AS to be acquitted.', 'strength_assessment': 'weak', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'tvisteloven § 20-2, § 20-5', 'factual_basis': 'Plaintiffs won the case, thus entitled to full compensation for necessary and reasonable legal costs.', 'relief_sought': 'Carl Danielsen and NordicGuard Insurance AS to compensate Anders Kristiansen and Berit Kristiansen for their legal costs.', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'N/A', 'factual_basis': 'Plaintiffs received compensation for value increase, so deprivation interest would lead to overcompensation.', 'relief_sought': 'Carl Danielsen and NordicGuard Insurance AS to be acquitted of claim for deprivation interest.', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}], 'file_id': '11a18e02-8669-4d6e-88e5-4cafcfaa236c', 'key_provisions': ['Eiendommen ble «solgt som den er», jf. avhendingsloven § 3 -9.', 'Forliksavtalen av 30. mars 2022 er bortfalt og partenes forpliktelser etter denne er opphørt.', 'Carl Danielsen og NordicGuard Insurance AS dømmes in solidum til å betale Anders Kristiansen og Berit Kristiansen 6 280 000 – seksmillionertohundreogåttitusen – kroner med tillegg av lovens forsinkelsesrente fra 21. juli 2021 til betaling skjer, mot overføring av hjemmelen til Fjellveien 42A, gnr. 203 bnr. 174 i Stavanger kommune.', 'Carl Danielsen og NordicGuard Insurance AS dømmes in solidum til å betale 1 072 413 – enmillionogsyttitotusenfirehundreogtretten – kroner i erstatning til Anders Kristiansen og Berit Kristiansen.', 'Carl Danielsen og NordicGuard Insurance AS frifinnes for krav om betaling av avsavnsrente.', 'Carl Danielsen og NordicGuard Insurance AS dømmes in solidum til å betale 628 227 – sekshundreogtjueåttetusentohundreogtjuesju – kroner i sakskostnader til Anders Kristiansen og Berit Kristiansen.', 'Saken 21 -163881 TVI stanses jfr tvl § 16 -17.', 'Søknad som angitt over innsendes så snart som mulig etter at avtalen er godkjent, jfr pkt 4.', 'Dersom tiltak i pkt 2 ikke godkjennes skal saken settes i gang igjen.', 'Misligholdet mellom tingens stand og det kjøper kunne regne med, må være «utvilsomt» for at vesentlighetskravet skal være oppfyllt, jf. Ot.prp. nr. 66 (1990 –1991) s. 92.', 'Utbedringskostnadene normalt må overstige 15 -20 % av kjøpesummen for at hevingsvilkåret skal være oppfyllt.', 'Saksøkte har tapt sin rett til å gjøre gjeldende at hevingserklæringen ble fremsatt for sent.', 'Kjøperen kan heve avtalen dersom mangelen innebærer et «vesentleg avtalebrot»', 'Kjøper har krav på erstatning for direkte tap som følge av mangelen uten at det foreligger skyld på selgers side, med mindre det godtgjøres at mangelen skyldes forhold utenfor hans kontroll.', 'Avsavnsrenter er en renteform som skal kompensere for utilsiktet kreditt der betingelsene for forsinkelsesrenter ikke er oppfyllt.', 'Saksøkerne har fått medhold i det vesentlige og har vunnet saken, jf. tvisteloven § 20 -2 andre ledd.'], 'file_date': '2025-07-16', 'category': 'court_order'}
