{'title': 'Formal rescission of settlement agreement for Fjellveien 42A', 'description': 'Juridisk Byrå AS formally rescinds the settlement agreement for Fjellveien 42A on behalf of Anders and Berit Kristiansen. The rescission is based on contractual breach (failure to submit application for over a year), material breach, and broken premises, as a new expert report indicates the concrete deck requires demolition and reconstruction, not just repair. The letter also states the intention to reopen the case in court.', 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['legal_rep_plaintiff', 'defendant', 'insurer', 'legal_rep_defendant', 'plaintiff'], 'deadlines': [], 'damages': [], 'claims': [{'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': "Kontraktsbrudd, likestilling med 'ikke godkjent' (forlikets pkt. 6), vesentlig mislighold, bristende forutsetninger.", 'factual_basis': "Over 1 year passed since settlement without application being sent, breaching 'as soon as possible' clause. Failure to ensure 'necessary boundary adjustment'. New expert report (BetongTeknikk AS, Feb 24, 2023) concludes 'floating joist system' is unsatisfactory and deck must be demolished and rebuilt.", 'relief_sought': 'Heving av forliksavtalen', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}], 'file_id': 'c6ded343-c148-4d7f-8381-4adf9033dd93', 'key_provisions': ['Settlement agreement dated March 30, 2022, is hereby rescinded.', "Application for measures in point 2 of the settlement was to be sent 'as soon as possible' after approval (April 5, 2022).", 'Over 12 months passed without an application being sent.', "Failure to send application for over 1 year is equated with the measure 'not approved' (Settlement point 6).", "A new report from BetongTeknikk AS (Feb 24, 2023) concludes that the 'floating joist system' is unsatisfactory, and the deck must be demolished and rebuilt.", 'The district court will be asked to reopen the case.', 'All rights from the original summons are reserved.'], 'file_date': '2023-04-18', 'category': 'legal_opinion'}
