e rescission claim.', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'avhendingsloven § 3-9, avhendingsloven § 4-14', 'factual_basis': 'Acknowledged some hidden defects relevant to defect assessment (avhl. § 3-9). Relationship with annex/concrete deck is a deviation. Exceeding property boundary is a deviation, as is the summer house and missing door. Wall outside annex and along garage may be deviations. Defendants dispute the size of price reduction, claiming plaintiffs are only entitled to cheapest necessary remediation. Deduction must be made for already paid price reduction as per settlement.', 'relief_sought': "Carl Danielsen and NordicGuard Insurance AS ordered to pay price reduction and/or compensation to Anders and Berit Kristiansen, limited by court's discretion.", 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'Not explicitly stated, but standard legal practice.', 'factual_basis': 'Legal costs incurred.', 'relief_sought': 'Anders and Berit Kristiansen ordered to compensate Carl Danielsen and NordicGuard Insurance AS for legal costs.', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}], 'file_id': '75fafaa0-4561-4a29-a679-71dcfbf94c71', 'key_provisions': [], 'file_date': '2025-06-06', 'category': 'pleading'}
