{'title': 'Reservation for Rescission of Property Purchase - Fjellveien 42A', 'description': 'Emma Hansen from Juridisk Byrå AS, on behalf of Anders and Berit Kristiansen, sent a formal letter to Carl Danielsen and NordicGuard Insurance AS, reserving the right to rescind the property purchase of Fjellveien 42A. The letter cites significant defects including a leak in the concrete deck, non-compliant concrete deck construction, missing load-bearing beams, uncertain load-bearing capacity, annex encroachment on neighboring property, and possible deviations from building permits, asserting these constitute a significant breach under avhendingsloven §§ 3-7 and 3-9, and reserving the right to rescind under § 4-13. A response is requested within 10 working days.', 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['legal_rep_plaintiff', 'plaintiff', 'defendant', 'insurer'], 'deadlines': [{'deadline_id': None, 'deadline_date': '2020-06-02', 'description': 'Response requested within 10 working days.', 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}], 'damages': [], 'claims': [{'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'avhendingsloven § 3-7, § 3-9, § 4-13', 'factual_basis': 'Leak in concrete deck, non-compliant concrete deck construction, missing load-bearing beams, uncertain load-bearing capacity, annex encroachment on neighboring property, possible deviations from building permits.', 'relief_sought': 'Rescission of property purchase.', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'high'}], 'file_id': '35b81cbf-1fec-43f0-b9e7-9afc66ae5a9b', 'key_provisions': [], 'file_date': '2020-05-19', 'category': 'legal_opinion'}
