{'title': 'Meeting Minutes: Rescission Options and Consequences', 'description': "Meeting minutes from May 19, 2020, with Anders, Berit, and Emma Hansen, discussing the legal grounds for rescission of the property purchase and its consequences. The Kristiansens' situation (two children sharing a room, planned rental income of 9000 kr/month from the annex now impossible) was reviewed. Alternatives considered were rescinding the purchase (1-2 years), demanding a price reduction (faster), or letting the seller remedy (uncertain). The decision was made to send a reservation for rescission the next day and await the seller's reaction.", 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['plaintiff', 'legal_rep_plaintiff'], 'deadlines': [], 'damages': [], 'claims': [], 'file_id': 'f0a67a7e-f310-4521-b346-8a3e82c94d4b', 'key_provisions': [], 'file_date': '2020-05-19T14:00:00', 'category': 'meeting_minutes'}
