{'title': "Defendants' Final Pleading: Validity of Settlement, Reject Annulment", 'description': 'This document is the defendants\' final pleading to the Rogaland District Court, asserting the validity of the March 2022 settlement agreement and rejecting the plaintiffs\' annulment claim. They argue that the concrete deck solution agreed upon is satisfactory and that any delays in the application process are not due to their passivity. They also contend that the property was sold "as is," limiting their liability, and that the rescission declaration was submitted too late. They acknowledge some minor defects but dispute the extent of remediation costs and the basis for annulment or extensive compensation.', 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['Anders Kristiansen', 'Berit Kristiansen', 'Emma Hansen', 'Carl Danielsen', 'NordicGuard Insurance AS', 'Fredrik Larsen', 'Tore Bakke', 'Thomas Strand'], 'deadlines': [{'deadline_id': None, 'deadline_date': '2025-06-09', 'description': 'Deadline for submitting the final pleading.', 'file_id': '7a0c86ce-b000-4592-9426-f13fdd0c6516', 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}], 'damages': [{'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 1500000, 'currency': None, 'basis': 'Proposed price reduction offer - implied max based on previous settlement, but not explicitly stated as a damage, rather a claim limit', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 2000000, 'currency': None, 'basis': 'Proposed price reduction offer - implied max based on previous settlement, but not explicitly stated as a damage, rather a claim limit', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 3000000, 'currency': None, 'basis': 'Proposed price reduction offer - implied max based o