{'title': 'Meeting Minutes: Site Inspection Fjellveien 42A', 'description': 'This document is the meeting minutes from a site inspection (befaring) conducted by Hordaland District Court at Fjellveien 42A on June 24, 2025. Attendees included the judge, Anders and Berit Kristiansen, their lawyer Emma Hansen, Carl Danielsen, his lawyer Fredrik Larsen, and experts Tommy Hansen (BERAS) and Tore Bakke (Stavanger Takst AS). The inspection covered the annex (rental unit), concrete deck/terrace, shed/conservatory, three retaining walls (Mur A, B, C), and property boundaries. Various defects were observed, including moisture damage, cracks in the concrete deck, annex encroachment, and unapproved walls, with differing expert opinions on their severity and remediation.', 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['Ragnhild Haugen', 'Anders Kristiansen', 'Berit Kristiansen', 'Emma Hansen', 'Carl Danielsen', 'Fredrik Larsen', 'Tommy Hansen', 'Tore Bakke', 'Berit Jensen'], 'deadlines': [], 'damages': [{'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': None, 'currency': None, 'basis': 'Visible moisture damage and discoloration in the ceiling of the rental unit, problematic construction of the concrete deck, cracks in the concrete deck extending to reinforcement, areas of deflection, missing load-bearing beams, punctured membrane.', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}], 'claims': [], 'file_id': '5a24ee7a-3db6-4f74-9e8a-a35d8fc8b3f5', 'key_provisions': [], 'file_date': '2025-06-24', 'category': 'meeting_minutes'}
