{'title': 'Witness Testimony Notes: Tommy Hansen (BERAS)', 'description': 'This document contains notes from the witness testimony of Tommy Hansen from BERAS (Bergen Eiendomsrådgivning AS) during the main hearing on June 24, 2025. Hansen, an experienced property advisor, testified about several serious defects at Fjellveien 42A, including the annex encroaching on neighboring property (regulated as green area), structural weaknesses in the concrete deck, an illegally placed shed, and three unapproved walls. He expressed strong certainty that the municipality would not grant dispensation for the annex encroachment and that the concrete deck required demolition and reconstruction. He also estimated total remediation costs to be at least NOK 4-5 million.', 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['Tommy Hansen', 'Emma Hansen', 'Fredrik Larsen', 'Berit Jensen', 'Thor Berntsen'], 'deadlines': [], 'damages': [{'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 1000000, 'currency': None, 'basis': 'Estimated cost for omregulering for annex encroachment - lower range', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 1500000, 'currency': None, 'basis': 'Estimated cost for omregulering for annex encroachment - upper range', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 4000000, 'currency': None, 'basis': 'Estimated total cost for bringing property to legal standard - lower range', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 5000000, 'currency': None, 'basis': 'Estimated total cost for bringing property to legal standard - upper range', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': No