{'title': 'Judgment: Annulment of Property Purchase and Compensation', 'description': "The Rogaland District Court ruled on July 16, 2025, that the settlement agreement of March 30, 2022, is void, and the property purchase agreement for Fjellveien 42A is annulled. Carl Danielsen and NordicGuard Insurance AS are ordered to repay the purchase price of NOK 6,280,000, pay NOK 1,072,413 in damages, and cover legal costs of NOK 628,227. The court found significant defects, including annex encroachment, structural flaws in the concrete deck, and unapproved walls, constituting a material breach. The defendants' argument of late rescission was rejected due to passivity.", 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['Ingrid Andersen', 'Anders Kristiansen', 'Berit Kristiansen', 'Carl Danielsen', 'NordicGuard Insurance AS', 'Emma Hansen', 'Fredrik Larsen', 'K2 Taksering AS', 'Byggesøk Vest AS', 'Tore Bakke', 'Tommy Hansen', 'Thor Berntsen', 'Thomas Strand', 'Martin Solberg', 'Sivertsen Entreprenør AS', 'Tertnes Entreprenør AS', 'Øygarden Betongentreprenør AS'], 'deadlines': [{'deadline_id': None, 'deadline_date': '2021-07-21', 'description': 'Interest on the purchase price runs from 30 days after the rescission claim was made.', 'file_id': '9b860d06-3a37-42d1-9590-708eaa50684b', 'email_id': '', 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'deadline_id': None, 'deadline_date': '2022-04-27', 'description': 'The case was stayed on April 27, 2022, and the maximum two-year period for a stayed case expired at the end of April 2024.', 'file_id': '9b860d06-3a37-42d1-9590-708eaa50684b', 'email_id': '', 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'deadline_id': None, 'deadline_date': '2025-07-30', 'description': 'The fulfillment deadline for the judgment is two weeks from its pronouncement (July 16, 2025).', 'file_id': '9b860d06-3a37-42d1-9590-708eaa50684b', 'email_id': '', 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}], 'damages': [{'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'am