{'title': 'Valuation Report on Property Defects Fjellveien 42A', 'description': 'A valuation report by Stavanger Takst AS for Advokatfirmaet Nord, dated May 15, 2021. It assesses alleged defects at Fjellveien 42A and estimates remediation costs. Key identified defects include the extension being partly outside property boundaries, concrete slab structural weaknesses, missing internal door, unapproved outbuilding, and unapproved walls. Estimated minimum costs for legalization are NOK 1.2-1.4 million, while maximum costs for demolition/reconstruction are NOK 6-7 million. The report concludes with a finding of property defect under avhendingsloven § 3-9.', 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['Advokatfirmaet Nord', 'Fredrik Larsen', 'Tore Bakke', 'Martin Solberg', 'Anders Kristiansen', 'Berit Kristiansen', 'Skandia Bygg AS', 'Byggesøknad Stavanger AS'], 'deadlines': [], 'damages': [], 'claims': [], 'file_id': '0dd45ca7-c0df-4233-8708-50837c27b47d', 'key_provisions': ['Extension partly outside property boundary (0.8m) and in conflict with building permit and private agreement.', 'Concrete slab has structural weaknesses and uncertain load-bearing capacity.', 'Missing internal door between extension and main house, violating change of use permit.', "Outbuilding/conservatory placed against neighbor's boundary without consent or public permit.", 'Three walls (A, B, C) not applied for; Mur A is partly over property boundary.', 'Minimum cost for legalization: approx. NOK 1,195,000 - 1,395,000 (excl. VAT).', 'Maximum cost for demolition/reconstruction: approx. NOK 6,350,000 - 6,850,000 (excl. VAT).', 'Property defect identified under avhendingsloven § 3-9.'], 'file_date': '2021-05-15', 'category': 'expert_report'}
