{'title': 'Internal Memo Regarding Carl Danielsen Property Case', 'description': 'An internal memo from the Claims Department to the Legal Department at NordicGuard Insurance AS, dated June 15, 2021. It discusses the Carl Danielsen case regarding Fjellveien 42A, noting that buyers are demanding annulment of the purchase and compensation, with an estimated exposure of NOK 7-10 million. The memo confirms liability insurance coverage up to NOK 10 million with a NOK 150,000 deductible and recommends Advokatfirmaet Nord for legal representation.', 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['Carl Danielsen', 'NordicGuard Insurance AS', 'Kari Berg', 'Advokatfirmaet Nord'], 'deadlines': [], 'damages': [], 'claims': [], 'file_id': '1a913cdf-6f3f-4144-b58d-53bba216c35c', 'key_provisions': ['Buyers demand annulment + compensation.', 'Estimated exposure: NOK 7-10 million.', 'Liability insurance covers up to NOK 10 million.', 'Deductible: NOK 150,000.', 'Recommendation: Advokatfirmaet Nord for legal representation.'], 'file_date': '2021-06-15', 'category': 'internal_memo'}
