{'title': 'Annulment Declaration for Fjellveien 42A Property Purchase', 'description': 'An annulment declaration from Juridisk Byrå AS on behalf of Anders and Berit Kristiansen to Carl Danielsen and NordicGuard Insurance AS, dated June 21, 2021. It declares the annulment of the property purchase of Fjellveien 42A due to significant defects, citing avhendingsloven § 4-13. The defects include issues with the concrete slab, property boundaries, illegal outbuilding, and other technical deviations. The total claim for the annulment settlement is NOK 9,778,904 after a deduction for a partial payment. A 14-day deadline for response and settlement is given.', 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['Anders Kristiansen', 'Berit Kristiansen', 'Carl Danielsen', 'NordicGuard Insurance AS', 'Juridisk Byrå AS', 'Emma Hansen'], 'deadlines': [], 'damages': [{'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 7030000, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'Repayment of purchase price', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 186600, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'Purchase costs', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'damage_id': None, 'category': 'consequential', 'amount': 2210000, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'Lost increase in value', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'damage_id': None, 'category': 'consequential', 'amount': 307204, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'Lost rental income', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 49662, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'Moving costs', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'damage_id'