{'title': 'Technical Assessment of Concrete Slab Fjellveien 42A', 'description': 'A technical assessment by Konsulent Gruppen AS for Carl Danielsen / NordicGuard Insurance AS, dated October 21, 2021. This report evaluates the load-bearing capacity of the concrete slab at Fjellveien 42A based on documentation, without a physical inspection. It concludes that the slab has sufficient load-bearing capacity for current use despite deviations from pre-accepted solutions. It recommends establishing a floating joist floor ("roof over roof") and sealing existing cracks, considering demolition and reconstruction unnecessary.', 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['Carl Danielsen', 'NordicGuard Insurance AS', 'Konsulent Gruppen AS', 'Thomas Strand'], 'deadlines': [], 'damages': [], 'claims': [], 'file_id': 'bbbdc619-2d28-4fcc-8180-cda4b66ddacc', 'key_provisions': ['Assessment based on documentation, no physical inspection.', 'Conclusion: Slab has sufficient load-bearing capacity for current use.', 'Riss (cracks) not typical for overloading.', 'Oxygen and corrosion risk deemed not real based on documented crack sizes.', 'Recommended actions: Floating joist floor ("roof over roof"), sealing existing cracks internally, regular inspection.', 'Demolition and reconstruction deemed unnecessarily costly.'], 'file_date': '2021-10-21', 'category': 'expert_report'}
