{'title': 'Formal Rescission of Settlement Agreement', 'description': 'Juridisk Byrå AS formally rescinds the settlement agreement from March 30, 2022, on behalf of Anders and Berit Kristiansen. The letter cites breach of contract, non-approval of measures, material breach, and changed premises based on a new expert report, and announces the intention to reopen the court case.', 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['Carl Danielsen', 'NordicGuard Insurance AS', 'Fredrik Larsen', 'Anders Kristiansen', 'Berit Kristiansen', 'Emma Hansen', 'BetongTeknikk AS'], 'deadlines': [], 'damages': [], 'claims': [{'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'contract law (breach of contract)', 'factual_basis': 'It has been over 1 year since the settlement agreement was made, and no application has been sent to the municipality. The necessary boundary adjustment has not been ensured.', 'relief_sought': 'HEVING AV FORLIKSAVTALE', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'contract law (equating non-approval)', 'factual_basis': 'Not submitting an application for over a year must be equated with the measure not being approved, as per point 6 of the settlement.', 'relief_sought': 'HEVING AV FORLIKSAVTALE', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'general principles of contract law (material breach)', 'factual_basis': 'There is a material breach of the settlement agreement.', 'relief_sought': 'HEVING AV FORLIKSAVTALE', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'contract law (changed premises)', 'factual_basis': "The settlement was based on the premise that the concrete structure could be remedied with a 'floating beam structure'. A new report from BetongTeknikk AS (2023-02-24) concludes this solution is insufficient and demolition/reconstruction is required.", 'relief_sought': 'HEVING AV FORLIKSAVTALE', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}], 'file_id': '0132cec1-ca64-44e7-8a5d-30c4c525e317', 'key_provisions': ["Settlement agreement point 2 (application 'as soon as possible')", "Settlement agreement point 6 ('Dersom tiltak i pkt 2 ikke godkjennes skal saken settes i gang igjen.')"], 'file_date': '2023-04-18', 'category': 'correspondence'}
