{'title': "Grendelaget Vest's Conditions for Area Exchange", 'description': 'Grendelaget Vest (Langarinden Grendelag) informs Emma Hansen that they can accept the area exchange in principle but with conditions: the building must be movable or have fire safety measures if their property is developed, the wall must be movable, and all costs (surveying, registration, legal assistance) must be covered by the Kristiansens. They request a meeting.', 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['Grendelaget Vest', 'Emma Hansen'], 'deadlines': [], 'damages': [{'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': None, 'currency': None, 'basis': 'Costs for surveying, registration, legal assistance', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}], 'claims': [], 'file_id': '0bfd559d-940e-43a8-9ab5-30238dafcd82', 'key_provisions': ['VI KAN I PRINSIPPET GODTA makeskifte, men med VILKÅR', 'Dersom vi skal utvikle vår eiendom i fremtiden, må deres bygning kunne flyttes eller godta brannvegg/tiltak', 'Muren må være flyttbar (ikke permanent fundamentert)', 'Alle kostnader dekkes av dere (oppmåling, tinglysing, juridisk bistand)'], 'file_date': '2022-06-28', 'category': 'correspondence'}
