{'title': 'Rejection of settlement rescission', 'description': "Fredrik Larsen (Advokatfirmaet Nord), representing Carl Danielsen and NordicGuard Insurance AS, responds to Emma Hansen, rejecting the rescission of the settlement agreement from March 30, 2022. He argues the agreement is valid, his clients actively worked on obligations, the application process took time due to clarifications with the neighborhood association and neighbor, and 'as soon as possible' was not a strict deadline. He details the status of the application process, including contact with the neighborhood association for land exchange, a draft agreement, and neighbor's conditional consent. He also disputes the conclusions of the new Betong Consult report (dated 24.02.2023). He requests the rescission declaration be withdrawn or the case be brought to court again.", 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['Fredrik Larsen', 'Emma Hansen', 'Carl Danielsen', 'NordicGuard Insurance AS', 'Thor Berntsen', 'Martin Solberg', 'Thomas Strand'], 'deadlines': [{'deadline_id': None, 'deadline_date': '2023-05-16', 'description': 'Response requested within 14 days from May 2, 2023.', 'file_id': 'f47f6c4a-6efa-4723-aa63-9bcc0ff8ada9', 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}], 'damages': [], 'claims': [{'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'Implicitly related to contract law', 'factual_basis': 'Forliksavtalen er gyldig og bindende; Våre klienter har arbeidet aktivt med å oppfylle sine forpliktelser; Søknadsprosessen har tatt tid på grunn av nødvendige avklaringer med grendelaget og nabo; Det var aldri intensjon at søknad skulle vært sendt innen noen bestemt frist; "Så snart som mulig" må tolkes i lys av de reelle mulighetene.', 'relief_sought': 'Forliksavtalen opprettholdes; Rescission declaration withdrawn.', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'defendant', 'significance': 'medium'}], 'file_id': 'f47f6c4a-6efa-4723-aa63-9bcc0ff8a