{'title': 'Petition to reopen halted case', 'description': 'Emma Hansen, on behalf of Anders and Berit Kristiansen, submits a petition to Rogaland District Court on June 16, 2023, to reopen case number 21-123456TVI-ROGA/, which was halted on April 27, 2022. The petition states that the settlement agreement has been rescinded by their clients due to the counterparty\'s breach of contract (application not sent for over a year despite "as soon as possible" agreement) and vitiated assumptions (new report shows remediation method is insufficient). They request the case to proceed with ordinary treatment, maintaining their original claims from the summons, and ask the court to set deadlines for updated case preparation, additional pleadings, and a new main hearing schedule.', 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['Anders Kristiansen', 'Berit Kristiansen', 'Emma Hansen', 'Fredrik Larsen'], 'deadlines': [{'deadline_id': None, 'deadline_date': '2022-04-27', 'description': 'Case halted after petition from parties.', 'file_id': '2495f445-2aa8-4aaa-b621-2b761cfe66ef', 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}], 'damages': [], 'claims': [{'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'tvisteloven § 16-17', 'factual_basis': "Counterparty's breach of contract (application not sent); Vitiated assumptions (new report shows remediation method insufficient).", 'relief_sought': 'Reopen case for ordinary treatment; Uphold original claims from summons.', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'plaintiff', 'significance': 'medium'}], 'file_id': '2495f445-2aa8-4aaa-b621-2b761cfe66ef', 'key_provisions': [], 'file_date': '2023-06-16', 'category': 'pleading'}
