{'title': 'Petition to reopen case (Hordaland District Court)', 'description': "Emma Hansen, on behalf of Anders and Berit Kristiansen, submits a petition to Hordaland District Court on June 16, 2023, to reopen case 21-163881TVI-THRD/TBER, which has been pending since March 30, 2022. The petition argues the settlement agreement is invalid due to: (a) breach of contract (application not sent within 3 months, 12 months passed); (b) vitiated assumptions (settlement based on deck repair, new report shows it's impossible - avtaleloven § 36); (c) impossibility (land exchange with neighbor failed, neighbor sets unacceptable conditions). It also notes that the maximum 24-month period for a halted case (tvisteloven § 16-17) expires in March 2024, leaving time to complete the case.", 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['Anders Kristiansen', 'Berit Kristiansen', 'Emma Hansen'], 'deadlines': [{'deadline_id': None, 'deadline_date': '2022-06-30', 'description': 'Application was supposed to be sent within 3 months of March 30, 2022.', 'file_id': '6db3e0b1-c927-4e85-b74a-731bf094e3f4', 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'deadline_id': None, 'deadline_date': '2024-03-31', 'description': 'Maximum 24-month period for case inactivity (tvisteloven § 16-17) expires.', 'file_id': '6db3e0b1-c927-4e85-b74a-731bf094e3f4', 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}], 'damages': [], 'claims': [{'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'avtaleloven § 36, tvisteloven § 16-17', 'factual_basis': 'Settlement agreement invalid due to breach of contract (application not sent), vitiated assumptions (new report shows repair impossible), and impossibility (land exchange failed).', 'relief_sought': 'Reopen case; Uphold grounds for rescission of purchase contract.', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'plaintiff', 'significance': 'medium'}], 'file_id': '6db3e0b1-c927-4e85-b74a-731bf094e3f4', 'key_provisions': [], 'file_date': '2023-06-16', 'category': 'pleading'}
