{'title': 'Court decision to reopen case', 'description': "Hordaland District Court's decision (kjennelse) issued on July 5, 2023, to reopen case number 21-163881TVI-THRD/TBER. The court finds it probable that the settlement agreement has not been fulfilled as anticipated, citing documented lack of progress in the application process, a new technical report raising doubts about the solution, and problems with land exchange. Future process includes a preparatory meeting in September 2023 and the main hearing in spring/summer 2025.", 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['Ragnhild Haugen'], 'deadlines': [{'deadline_id': None, 'deadline_date': '2023-09-30', 'description': 'Preparatory meeting in September 2023.', 'file_id': '6bed2eb0-c008-4627-a5a4-9c56104830aa', 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'deadline_id': None, 'deadline_date': '2025-08-31', 'description': 'Main hearing in spring/summer 2025.', 'file_id': '6bed2eb0-c008-4627-a5a4-9c56104830aa', 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}], 'damages': [], 'claims': [], 'file_id': '6bed2eb0-c008-4627-a5a4-9c56104830aa', 'key_provisions': [], 'file_date': '2023-07-05', 'category': 'court_order'}
