{'title': 'Pre-conference minutes on legalizing illegal structures', 'description': "Minutes from a pre-conference on September 20, 2023, at Stavanger City Hall, between Kari Johansen (Stavanger Municipality), Anders Kristiansen, and Emma Hansen. The discussion focused on legalizing illegal structures at Fjellveien 42A. Issues include the extension being partly outside the property boundary and on a green area, originally applied for as a garage but changed to a residential unit. The municipality finds this problematic and uncertain for dispensation. An outbuilding/winter garden is unsought and located against a neighbor's retaining wall, likely needing demolition or relocation. The approval status of existing walls is also unclear. The municipality requested exact mapping, documentation of wall approvals, clarification with the neighborhood association for land exchange, and assessment of which measures to apply for.", 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['Kari Johansen', 'Anders Kristiansen', 'Emma Hansen'], 'deadlines': [], 'damages': [], 'claims': [], 'file_id': '5567f631-257a-4363-b8e3-c3384703e3dc', 'key_provisions': [], 'file_date': '2023-09-21', 'category': 'meeting_minutes'}
