{'title': 'New deviations: Unapproved walls', 'description': 'Emma Hansen sends an email to Anders and Berit Kristiansen on September 21, 2023, summarizing the pre-conference with the municipality on September 20, 2023. Three unapproved walls were discovered: Mur A (along extension, partly outside property, on green area), Mur B (along garage), and Mur C (along Fjellveien). These are significant additions to existing deviations and must be legalized, moved, or demolished. Emma recommends documenting these new deviations, getting cost estimates for remediation, and assessing if this changes the basis for rescission or impacts the March 2022 settlement agreement. She suggests asking Tommy Hansen (BERAS) for an assessment.', 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['Emma Hansen', 'Anders Kristiansen', 'Berit Kristiansen', 'Tommy Hansen'], 'deadlines': [], 'damages': [], 'claims': [], 'file_id': '5d4dbae2-fc5b-42c4-a502-956a4f4b3a04', 'key_provisions': [], 'file_date': '2023-09-21', 'category': 'correspondence'}
