{'title': 'Formal Annulment of Settlement Agreement', 'description': "Juridisk Byrå AS, on behalf of Anders and Berit Kristiansen, formally annuls the settlement agreement dated March 30, 2022. The letter details legal grounds including breach of contract (failure to send application and ensure boundary adjustment for over a year), equating non-submission with non-approval of measures, material breach, and frustrated purpose (new report from BetongTeknikk AS shows the 'floating joist' solution is insufficient and demolition/reconstruction is required). The letter states intent to ask the district court to resume the case.", 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['Anders Kristiansen', 'Berit Kristiansen', 'Carl Danielsen', 'NordicGuard Insurance AS', 'Emma Hansen', 'Fredrik Larsen'], 'deadlines': [], 'damages': [], 'claims': [{'claim_id': 'annulment_settlement_breach_contract_formal', 'legal_basis': 'Not explicitly stated, based on settlement agreement', 'factual_basis': "Failure to send application 'så snart som mulig' after April 5, 2022 (over 12 months). Failure to ensure 'nødvendig grensejustering'.", 'relief_sought': 'HEVING AV FORLIKSAVTALE', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': '2d56671d-e4ad-4958-96d3-178cfd42f875', 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'plaintiff', 'significance': 'high'}, {'claim_id': 'annulment_settlement_non_approval', 'legal_basis': 'Forlikets punkt 6', 'factual_basis': 'Failure to send application for over 1 year is equivalent to the measure not being approved.', 'relief_sought': 'HEVING AV FORLIKSAVTALE', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': '2d56671d-e4ad-4958-96d3-178cfd42f875', 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'plaintiff', 'significance': 'high'}, {'claim_id': 'annulment_settlement_material_breach_formal', 'legal_basis': 'Alminnelige obligasjonsrettslige prinsipper', 'factual_basis': 'Significant breach of the settlement agreement.', 'relief_sought': 'HEVING AV FORLIKSAVTALE', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': '2d56671d-e4ad-4958-96d3-178cfd42f875', 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'plaintiff', 'significance': 'high'}, {'claim_id': 'annulment_settlement_frustrated_purpose_formal_letter', 'legal_basis': 'Læren om bristende forutsetninger', 'factual_basis': "Settlement based on premise that concrete slab could be repaired with 'svevende bjelkelag', which new report from BetongTeknikk AS (dated 24.02.2023) shows is insufficient; demolition and reconstruction required.", 'relief_sought': 'HEVING AV FORLIKSAVTALE', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': '2d56671d-e4ad-4958-96d3-178cfd42f875', 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'plaintiff', 'significance': 'high'}], 'file_id': '2d56671d-e4ad-4958-96d3-178cfd42f875', 'key_provisions': ['På vegne av våre klienter, Anders og Berit Kristiansen, heves herved forliksavtalen.', 'Det har nå gått over 12 måneder uten at søknad er sendt.', 'Dekket må rives og gjenoppbygges.', 'Vi vil nå be tingretten om å bringe saken i gang igjen.', 'Vi forbeholder oss alle rettigheter etter den opprinnelige stevningen.'], 'file_date': '2023-04-18', 'category': 'legal_opinion'}
