{'title': 'Settlement Agreement: Property Purchase Dispute', 'description': "This settlement agreement, dated March 30, 2022, and approved on April 5, 2022, formalizes the agreement reached during court mediation on March 15, 2022, between Anders and Berit Kristiansen (buyers) and Carl Danielsen and NordicGuard Insurance AS (defendants). The agreement outlines the halting of the court case, NordicGuard Insurance AS taking responsibility for the application process to legalize property modifications (new floor separation, outhouse, boundary dispensation, wall approvals), and an economic settlement of NOK 575,000 (net NOK 475,000 after a NOK 100,000 advance payment). The agreement is conditional on NordicGuard Insurance AS's approval within 10 working days. If the applications are not approved, the case will be reopened. Buyers waive further claims once the settlement is fulfilled. Each party bears its own legal costs.", 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['plaintiff', 'legal_rep_plaintiff', 'defendant', 'insurer', 'defense_counsel'], 'deadlines': [{'deadline_id': None, 'deadline_date': '2022-04-19', 'description': "Deadline for NordicGuard Insurance AS's claims handler to approve the settlement agreement.", 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'high'}, {'deadline_id': None, 'deadline_date': '2022-04-19', 'description': 'Deadline for payment of net NOK 475,000 after approval of the application process.', 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'high'}], 'damages': [{'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 575000, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'Agreed price reduction (gross)', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 100000, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'Advance payment deducted from settlement', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 475000, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'Net payment for price reduction', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}], 'claims': [{'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'avhendingsloven', 'factual_basis': 'Settlement reached after court mediation regarding defects at Fjellveien 42A, including concrete slab issues, property boundary violations, illegal outhouse, and unapproved walls.', 'relief_sought': 'Price reduction', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'plaintiff', 'significance': 'high'}], 'file_id': '23e6483b-ac5a-4e36-8c6b-71480ecd4422', 'key_provisions': ['Saksøkte, NordicGuard Insurance AS, tar ansvar for søknadsprosessen.', 'Søknadsprosessen skal omfatte: a) nytt etasjeskille (svevende bjelkelag), b) oppføring og plassering av uthus/vinterhage, c) dispensasjon fra reguleringsplan og plassering mot grense for tilbygget, d) godkjenning av murene.', 'Partene er enige om at saken skal begjæres hevet som forlikt når tiltak i pkt 2 er godkjent og NordicGuard Insurance AS har betalt kr 575 000,- (inkl. mva) fratrukket utbetalt a-konto beløp kr 100 000.', 'Dersom tiltak i pkt 2 ikke godkjennes skal saken settes i gang igjen.'], 'file_date': '2022-04-05', 'category': 'settlement_proposal'}
