{'title': 'Email Exchange: Makeskifte Proposal for Property Boundary', 'description': "An email exchange between Carl Danielsen and Skeie Grendelag (represented by Kari Lunde) from April 18 to May 2, 2022, regarding a makeskifte (land swap) proposal for Fjellveien 42A. Carl Danielsen proposes swapping approximately 25 sqm of land to legalize an annex partially encroaching on the grendelag's property. Skeie Grendelag expresses principal positivity but raises concerns about future development, fire safety, municipal approval, and requires detailed maps. Carl Danielsen addresses these concerns and suggests a meeting. The latest email from Carl Danielsen on May 2, 2022, proposes a meeting in week 20 or 21.", 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['defendant', 'defense_counsel', 'other'], 'deadlines': [{'deadline_id': None, 'deadline_date': '2022-09-01', 'description': "Skeie Grendelag's board must present the makeskifte proposal to the general assembly for final approval.", 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}], 'damages': [], 'claims': [], 'file_id': 'e575caf7-ac57-4e36-83a9-b229ba2061b4', 'key_provisions': [], 'file_date': '2022-05-02', 'category': 'correspondence'}
