{'title': 'Final Pleading to Stavanger District Court', 'description': 'A final pleading filed by Anders and Berit Kristiansen against Carl Danielsen and NordicGuard Insurance AS. It states the principal claim for annulment of the purchase and repayment of NOK 7,030,000, plus interest and compensation up to NOK 2,748,904. Subsidiarily, it claims a price reduction up to NOK 7,766,734 and compensation for lost rental income of NOK 307,204. It details the factual basis (property boundary encroachment, structural defects in concrete slab, illegal walls) and legal basis (annulment of settlement agreement due to breach and flawed premises, Avhl. §§ 3-7, 3-9, 4-13). It also outlines the calculation of restitution and damages.', 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['Anders Kristiansen', 'Berit Kristiansen', 'Emma Hansen', 'Carl Danielsen', 'NordicGuard Insurance AS', 'Fredrik Larsen', 'Stavanger Municipality'], 'deadlines': [{'deadline_id': None, 'deadline_date': '2025-06-09', 'description': 'Submission of final pleading two weeks before main hearing.', 'file_id': '79729914-ef1c-41e3-852b-ea8732b9c316', 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'deadline_id': None, 'deadline_date': '2021-07-21', 'description': 'Date for calculating default interest.', 'file_id': '79729914-ef1c-41e3-852b-ea8732b9c316', 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'deadline_id': None, 'deadline_date': '2019-08-01', 'description': 'Start date for calculating loss of use interest.', 'file_id': '79729914-ef1c-41e3-852b-ea8732b9c316', 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'deadline_id': None, 'deadline_date': '2021-07-21', 'description': 'End date for calculating loss of use interest.', 'file_id': '79729914-ef1c-41e3-852b-ea8732b9c316', 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}], 'damages': [{'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 7030000, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'Purchase pric