{'title': 'Expert Report on Concrete Deck Construction Fjellveien 42A', 'description': 'An expert report by Teknisk Rådgivning AS for Advokatfirmaet Nord, assessing the concrete deck in the annex at Fjellveien 42A, highlighting lack of documentation, deviations, and observed damages.', 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['Advokatfirmaet Nord', 'Fredrik Larsen', 'Teknisk Rådgivning AS', 'Thomas Strand'], 'deadlines': [], 'damages': [], 'claims': [], 'file_id': '89f5246b-b327-4af0-8758-bbaab07c4400', 'key_provisions': ['Concrete deck in annex (floor between rental unit and terrace) has leaks and uncertain load-bearing capacity.', 'Deviations: no load-bearing beams, incorrect thickness (200mm vs 250mm recommended), thinner polybetong, thicker concrete topping, no documentation.', 'Observed damages: leaks, cracks.', "Proposed solution: Floating joist system ('tak over tak') - prevents water, relieves deck, cost-effective, avoids demolition, but doesn't solve unknown load-bearing capacity.", 'Alternative: Demolition and reconstruction (high cost, extensive work).', 'Conclusion: Uncertainty regarding load-bearing capacity. Floating joist system is acceptable if conditions are met.'], 'file_date': '2021-10-21', 'category': 'expert_report'}
