{'title': 'Response on Fjellveien 42A Status - Stalled Negotiations', 'description': "Fredrik Larsen responds to Emma Hansen, apologizing for the delay. He explains that Grendelaget signed a draft area transfer agreement with conditions (fire safety cost of approx. 150,000 NOK and movable wall cost of approx. 500,000 NOK), but Kristiansens refused these conditions. The insurance company believes these costs should be covered by the owners as they are neighbor's requirements. Without a signed agreement, no application can be sent to the municipality. He concludes that the situation is stalled because the Kristiansens refuse to accept the neighbor's conditions, while the Kristiansens believe the insurance should cover these costs.", 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['legal_rep_defendant', 'legal_rep_plaintiff', 'other', 'plaintiff', 'insurer'], 'deadlines': [], 'damages': [{'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 150000, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'Estimated cost for fire safety measures, as required by Grendelaget.', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 500000, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'Estimated cost for making the wall movable, as required by Grendelaget.', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}], 'claims': [], 'file_id': 'e907fb6a-908e-43d4-8e08-e823dee13b35', 'key_provisions': ['Grendelaget har signert utkast til avtale om makeskifte', 'MEN: Grendelaget stiller krav om brannsikring (ca. kr 150 000) og at muren må kunne flyttes senere (ca. kr 500 000)', 'Dine klienter har ikke ønsket å akseptere disse betingelsene', 'Forsikringen mener disse kostnadene må dekkes av eierne da det er krav fra nabo', 'Uten signert avtale kan ikke søknad sendes til kommunen', 'Vi står altså i en låst situasjon.'], 'file_date': '2022-09-19', 'category': 'correspondence'}
