{'title': 'Settlement Agreement - Fjellveien 42A', 'description': "A formal settlement agreement signed on March 30, 2022, following court mediation on March 15, 2022, for the property Fjellveien 42A. It details the pausing of the case, the defendant's responsibility for the application process to legalize structures and adjust boundaries, and a financial settlement of NOK 575,000 (minus NOK 100,000 advance payment). The agreement is conditional on insurance approval and outlines actions if applications are not approved.", 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['Anders Kristiansen (buyer)', 'Berit Kristiansen (buyer)', 'Carl Danielsen (defendant)', 'NordicGuard Insurance AS (defendant)', 'Emma Hansen (lawyer for buyers)', 'Ola Nordmann (claims handler for NordicGuard Insurance AS)', 'Fredrik Larsen (lawyer for defendants)'], 'deadlines': [{'deadline_id': None, 'deadline_date': '2022-04-19', 'description': "NordicGuard Insurance AS' claims handler to approve the agreement within 10 working days (from March 30, 2022).", 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'deadline_id': None, 'deadline_date': '2022-04-19', 'description': 'Payment of the settlement amount within 14 days after approval (assuming approval on April 5, the deadline would be April 19).', 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}], 'damages': [{'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 575000, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'Settlement amount', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 100000, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'Advance payment subtracted from settlement', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 475000, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'Net payment amount', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}], 'claims': [], 'file_id': 'ed757749-ff60-4aa5-a485-5be5fece08f5', 'key_provisions': ['Case 21-123456 TVI is paused.', "NordicGuard Insurance AS takes responsibility for the application process, which includes: establishing a new floor separation (floating joist), constructing and placing an outhouse/conservatory, obtaining dispensation for the annex's placement against the boundary, and approving the walls.", 'Defendant ensures necessary boundary adjustment, covering all expenses.', 'Application to be submitted as soon as possible after agreement approval.', 'Case to be dismissed as settled when measures in point 2 are approved and NordicGuard Insurance AS has paid NOK 575,000 (minus NOK 100,000 advance).', "Agreement is conditional on NordicGuard Insurance AS' claims handler approving it within 10 working days.", 'If the agreement is not approved, the case continues.', 'Buyers waive further claims against defendant once the settlement is fulfilled.', 'If measures in point 2 are not approved, the case will be restarted.', 'Each party bears their own legal costs.', 'Parties commit to treating the settlement content confidentially.'], 'file_date': '2022-03-30', 'category': 'agreement'}
