{'title': 'Concluding Pleading - Plaintiffs', 'description': "A concluding pleading from Juridisk Byrå AS on behalf of Anders and Berit Kristiansen, submitted to Rogaland Tingrett. It argues that the settlement agreement of March 30, 2022, is void due to the defendants' non-fulfillment of obligations (failure to send application for 3 years) and/or a fundamental misunderstanding (bristende forutsetninger) regarding the concrete structure's repairability. It reiterates the extensive defects (annex on neighbor's property, concrete slab, unapproved walls, etc.) and high remediation costs (minimum 4.3 million NOK, potentially over 7.7 million NOK including value loss), concluding that these constitute a significant breach justifying rescission. It also defends the timeliness of the rescission declaration, arguing the defendant lost the right to challenge it due to passivity. The pleading outlines the full claim for rescission and damages, including repayment of purchase price (7,030,000 NOK), various costs (186,600 NOK purchase, 49,662 NOK moving, 49,287 NOK upgrades, 6,151 NOK initial remediation), lost appreciation (2,210,000 NOK), and lost rental income (307,204 NOK), plus interest.", 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['plaintiff', 'defendant', 'insurer', 'legal_rep_plaintiff', 'other', 'contractor', 'expert'], 'deadlines': [], 'damages': [{'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 3437298, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': "Demolition and reconstruction of concrete deck based on Skandia Bygg AS's indexed price offer.", 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 60000, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'Søknadsprosess eiendomsgrense.', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 25141, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 