{'title': 'Witness Statement: Tommy Hansen (ERV AS)', 'description': "Notes from the witness testimony of Tommy Hansen (Eiendomsrådgivning Vest AS) during the main hearing on June 24, 2025. He detailed several serious defects at Fjellveien 42A, including boundary violations, concrete deck issues, and unapproved walls, and expressed certainty that legalization of the annex's boundary issue would be rejected by the municipality.", 'significance': 'high', 'party_roles': ['Tommy Hansen', 'Eiendomsrådgivning Vest AS', 'Emma Hansen', 'Fredrik Larsen', 'Rogaland Tingrett', 'Berit Jensen'], 'deadlines': [], 'damages': [{'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 1000000, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'expert estimate', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 1500000, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'expert estimate', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 4000000, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'expert estimate', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}, {'damage_id': None, 'category': 'direct_losses', 'amount': 5000000, 'currency': 'NOK', 'basis': 'expert estimate', 'supporting_evidence': [], 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': None, 'significance': 'medium'}], 'claims': [{'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': 'Plan- og bygningsloven', 'factual_basis': 'Annex 0.8m outside property boundary, on common play area, violates building permit and neighbor agreement. Stavanger municipality has high threshold for such dispensations. Requires dispensation, grendelag consent, and boundary adjustment. Omregulering (rezoning) is very costly and time-consuming.', 'relief_sought': '(Implicitly, supports rescission/damages)', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': "Defendant's lawyer questioned if witness spoke to municipality about this specific case, noted difference between public and common play area, and mentioned grendelag consent and long-standing building as factors.", 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'witness', 'significance': 'medium'}, {'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': '', 'factual_basis': 'Deck not built to accepted standards, lacks load-bearing beams, uncertain load-bearing capacity. Agrees with Thor Berntsen (Betongteknikk AS) that rebar corrosion will continue with "floating joist" solution.', 'relief_sought': 'Demolition and reconstruction of concrete deck.', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': "Defendant's lawyer noted witness did not perform technical measurements himself.", 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'witness', 'significance': 'medium'}, {'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': '', 'factual_basis': 'Mur A partly over property boundary. Mur B and C unapproved.', 'relief_sought': 'Mur A must be moved; Mur B and C require application process for legalization.', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'witness', 'significance': 'medium'}, {'claim_id': None, 'legal_basis': '', 'factual_basis': 'Sum of costs for various defects.', 'relief_sought': 'Compensation for remediation/legalization costs.', 'strength_assessment': 'strong', 'defense': None, 'file_id': None, 'email_id': None, 'party_role': 'witness', 'significance': 'medium'}], 'file_id': '454b0dfd-bc0e-4da2-bb93-46334d6b7dde', 'key_provisions': [], 'file_date': '2025-06-24', 'category': 'witness_statement'}
